      "uz_compare": "-지만 o'zbekchadagi 'lekin, ammo' ga to'g'ri keladi, faqat koreyschada u birinchi qismning oxiriga qo'shiladi: 'Qiyin, LEKIN qiziqarli' = 어렵지만 재미있어요.",
      "compare_en": "-지만 matches English 'but', except that in Korean it is an ending on the first clause: 'It's hard, BUT it's fun' = 어렵지만 재미있어요."
