  "dialogue": {
    "lines": [
      {
        "speaker": "teacher",
        "ko": "아지즈 씨는 주말에 보통 뭐 해요?",
        "uz": "Aziz, dam olish kunlari odatda nima qilasiz?",
        "en": "Aziz, what do you usually do at the weekend?",
        "audio": "ca5a9ab32fd6.mp3"
      },
      {
        "speaker": "aziz",
        "ko": "저는 등산하는 걸 좋아해요. 그래서 주말에 자주 산에 가요.",
        "uz": "Men toqqa chiqishni yaxshi ko'raman. Shuning uchun dam olish kunlari tez-tez toqqa boraman.",
        "en": "I like hiking. So I often go to the mountains at the weekend.",
        "audio": "d9cf026409ef.mp3"
      },
      {
        "speaker": "teacher",
        "ko": "와, 등산은 힘들지 않아요?",
        "uz": "Voy, toqqa chiqish og'ir emasmi?",
        "en": "Wow, isn't hiking tiring?",
        "audio": "2e29a83cc7a0.mp3"
      },
      {
        "speaker": "aziz",
        "ko": "힘들지만 재미있어요. 산에서 경치를 보는 게 정말 좋아요.",
        "uz": "Og'ir, lekin qiziqarli. Tog'dan manzarani tomosha qilish juda yoqimli.",
        "en": "It's tiring, but it's fun. Looking at the view from the mountain is really nice.",
        "audio": "e24e28ed4b3c.mp3"
      },
      {
        "speaker": "teacher",
        "ko": "어느 산에 자주 가요?",
        "uz": "Qaysi toqqa tez-tez borasiz?",
        "en": "Which mountain do you often go to?",
        "audio": "8b307b39db9e.mp3"
      },
      {
        "speaker": "aziz",
        "ko": "보통 북한산에 가요. 선생님은 취미가 뭐예요?",
        "uz": "Odatda Pukhansanga boraman. Ustoz, sizning xobbingiz nima?",
        "en": "I usually go to Bukhansan. Teacher, what's your hobby?",
        "audio": "ad33cc5e225b.mp3"
      },
      {
        "speaker": "teacher",
        "ko": "제 취미는 요리하는 거예요. 특히 빵을 만드는 걸 좋아해요.",
        "uz": "Mening xobbim — ovqat pishirish. Ayniqsa non yopishni yaxshi ko'raman.",
        "en": "My hobby is cooking. I especially love baking bread.",
        "audio": "309b9760a795.mp3"
      },
      {
        "speaker": "aziz",
        "ko": "저는 요리를 거의 못 해요.",
        "uz": "Men deyarli ovqat pishira olmayman.",
        "en": "I can hardly cook at all.",
        "audio": "f16394c9d2a7.mp3"
      },
      {
        "speaker": "teacher",
        "ko": "요리는 어렵지만 배우면 재미있어요.",
        "uz": "Pishirish qiyin, lekin o'rgansangiz qiziqarli.",
        "en": "Cooking is difficult, but it's fun once you learn.",
        "audio": "18828e350843.mp3"
      },
      {
        "speaker": "aziz",
        "ko": "그럼 다음에 저도 배우고 싶어요.",
        "uz": "Unda keyingi safar men ham o'rganmoqchiman.",
        "en": "Then I'd like to learn next time too.",
        "audio": "29f0c74d88cf.mp3"
      },
      {
        "speaker": "teacher",
        "ko": "좋아요. 같이 만들어 봐요.",
        "uz": "Yaxshi. Birga yopib ko'ramiz.",
        "en": "Good. Let's try baking together.",
        "audio": "fe880257e68e.mp3"
      }
    ]
  },
